# Data Source: identitynow_authorization_right_sets

Use this data source to list the right sets that can be assigned to [identitynow_custom_user_level](../resources/custom_user_level). The hierarchy is flattened: each right set is followed by its children.

~> **Note:** This data source uses an experimental API that may change without notice.

